          "text": "Health-related anxiety"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Patient reports being very scared that the increased events mean his brain is getting worse and worries about a brain tumour or another serious problem, and about status epilepticus going unnoticed. Repeatedly requested MRI every few months. Mother reports longstanding health anxiety and frequent googling about seizures, cancer, and stroke."
